#. (itstool) path: chapter/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:26
msgid ""
"A preference tool is a small application that allows you to change settings "
"in the MATE Desktop. Each preference tool covers a particular aspect of your"
" computer. For example, with the <application>Mouse</application> preference"
" tool you can set your mouse to left-handed or right-handed use, or change "
"the speed of the pointer on the screen. With the "
"<application>Windows</application> preference tool you can set behavior "
"common to all windows such as the way in which you select them with the "
"mouse."
msgstr ""
"Iestatījumu rīks ir neliela lietotne, ar kuru var mainīt MATE darbvirsmas "
"iestatījumus. Katrs iestatījumu rīks attiecas uz noteiktu datora aspektu. "
"Piemēram, ar iestatījumu rīku <application>Pele</application> var iestatīt "
"peli kreisajai vai labajai rokai vai mainīt rādītāja ātrumu ekrānā. Ar "
"iestatījumu rīku <application>Logi</application> var iestatīt visiem logiem "
"kopīgu uzvedību, piemēram, veidu, kā tos atlasa ar peli."

#. (itstool) path: chapter/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:27
msgid ""
"To open a preference tool, choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>System</guimenu><guisubmenu>Preferences</guisubmenu></menuchoice>"
" in the top panel. Choose the tool that you require from the submenu."
msgstr ""
"Lai atvērtu iestatījumu rīku, augšējā panelī izvēlieties <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>Sistēma</guimenu><guisubmenu>Iestatījumi</guisubmenu></menuchoice>. "
"No apakšizvēlnes izvēlieties vajadzīgo rīku."

#. (itstool) path: chapter/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:28
