msgstr ""
"Lietotņu logus var minimizēt, maksimizēt un aizvērt ar virsraksta joslas "
"pogām. Atverot lietotni, parasti parādās šāda veida logs."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gosoverview.xml:174
msgid "Dialog windows"
msgstr "Dialoglodziņi"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:176
msgid ""
"Dialog windows appear at the request of an application window. A dialog "
"window may alert you to a problem, ask for confirmation of an action, or "
"request input from you."
msgstr ""
"Dialoglodziņi parādās pēc lietotnes loga pieprasījuma. Dialoglodziņš var "
"brīdināt par problēmu, prasīt apstiprināt darbību vai lūgt kaut ko ievadīt."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:178
msgid ""
"For example, if you tell an application to save a document, a dialog will "
"ask you where you want to save the new file. If you tell an application to "
"quit while it is still busy, it may ask you to confirm that you want it to "
"abandon work in progress."
msgstr ""
"Piemēram, ja liekat lietotnei saglabāt dokumentu, dialoglodziņā tiek "
"jautāts, kur saglabāt jauno failu. Ja liekat lietotnei beigt darbu, kamēr tā "
"vēl ir aizņemta, tā var lūgt apstiprināt, ka nepabeigtais darbs jāpārtrauc."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:180
msgid ""
"Some dialogs do not allow you to interact with the main application window "
"until you have closed them: these are called <firstterm>modal</firstterm> "
"dialogs. Others can be left open while you work with the main application "
"window: these are called <firstterm>transient</firstterm> dialogs."
msgstr ""
"Daži dialoglodziņi neļauj strādāt ar lietotnes galveno logu, kamēr tie nav "
"aizvērti: tos sauc par <firstterm>modālajiem</firstterm> dialoglodziņiem. "
