#. (itstool) path: appendix/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:9
msgid ""
"This section contains information on reporting bugs in MATE, making "
"suggestions and comments about MATE applications or documentation, and ways "
"in which you can help MATE."
msgstr ""
"Šajā sadaļā ir informācija par to, kā ziņot par MATE kļūdām, sniegt "
"ieteikumus un komentārus par MATE lietotnēm vai dokumentāciju un kā varat "
"palīdzēt MATE."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:11
msgid "Reporting Bugs"
msgstr "Kļūdu ziņošana"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:13
msgid ""
"If you have found a bug in a MATE application, please report it! Developers "
"do read all the bug reports and try to fix these bugs. Please try to be as "
"specific as possible when describing the circumstances under which the bug "
"shows (What commands did you enter? Which buttons did you click?). If there "
"were any error messages, be sure to include them, too."
msgstr ""
"Ja MATE lietotnē esat atraduši kļūdu, lūdzu, ziņojiet par to! Izstrādātāji "
"izlasa visus kļūdu ziņojumus un cenšas kļūdas novērst. Aprakstot apstākļus, "
"kādos kļūda rodas, esiet pēc iespējas precīzi (kādas komandas ievadījāt? uz "
"kurām pogām noklikšķinājāt?). Ja bija kļūdu paziņojumi, noteikti "
"pievienojiet arī tos."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:22
msgid ""
"The easiest way to report bugs is by connecting to the <link "
"xlink:href=\"https://github.com/mate-desktop/\">MATE bug tracking "
"database</link>, where you can also browse the list of known bugs. You will "
"need to register before you can submit any bugs this way."
msgstr ""
"Vienkāršāk par kļūdām ziņot <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/mate-"
"desktop/\">MATE kļūdu izsekošanas datubāzē</link>, kur var arī pārlūkot "
"zināmo kļūdu sarakstu. Lai šādi iesniegtu kļūdas, jāreģistrējas."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:27
msgid ""
"Please note that some of MATE applications are developed outside of MATE, or"
" by commercial companies (these products are still free software). For "
"example, <application>blueman</application>, a bluetooth application, is "
"developed at <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/blueman-"
"project/blueman/\">GitHub</link>. Bug reports and comments about these "
"products should be directed to the respective organization or company."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka dažas MATE lietotnes tiek izstrādātas ārpus MATE vai "
"komercuzņēmumos (šie produkti tomēr ir brīvā programmatūra). Piemēram, "
"Bluetooth lietotne <application>blueman</application> tiek izstrādāta <link "
"xlink:href=\"https://github.com/blueman-project/blueman/\">GitHub</link>. "
"Kļūdu ziņojumi un komentāri par šiem produktiem jāsūta attiecīgajai "
"organizācijai vai uzņēmumam."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:38
msgid "Suggestions and Comments"
msgstr "Ieteikumi un komentāri"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:40
msgid ""
"If you have a suggestion or want to request a new feature for one of the "
"applications, it can also be done using the bug tracking database. Submit "
"your suggestion as a bug report as described in <xref linkend=\"feedback-"
"bugs\"/> and at the appropriate step select <guilabel>Severity: "
"Enhancement</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ja jums ir ieteikums vai vēlaties pieprasīt kādai lietotnei jaunu iespēju, "
"to var izdarīt arī kļūdu izsekošanas datubāzē. Iesniedziet ieteikumu kā "
"kļūdas ziņojumu, kā aprakstīts <xref linkend=\"feedback-bugs\"/>, un "
"attiecīgajā solī izvēlieties <guilabel>Severity: Enhancement</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:49
msgid "Documentation Comments"
msgstr "Dokumentācijas komentāri"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:51
msgid ""
"If you found an inaccuracy or misprint in one of MATE documents, or have any"
" comments or suggestions about documentation, please let us know! The "
"easiest way of doing so is by submitting a bug report as explained before "
"and selecting <guilabel>Component: docs</guilabel> at appropriate steps (or "
"<guilabel>general</guilabel> if there is no <guilabel>docs</guilabel> "
"component). If your comment is about general MATE documentation (such as "
"<citetitle>MATE Users Guide</citetitle>) rather than specific application "
"manual, select <guilabel>Product: mate-user-docs</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ja kādā MATE dokumentā esat atraduši neprecizitāti vai drukas kļūdu vai jums "
"ir komentāri vai ieteikumi par dokumentāciju, lūdzu, dariet mums to zināmu! "
"Vienkāršāk to izdarīt, iesniedzot kļūdas ziņojumu, kā paskaidrots iepriekš, "
"un attiecīgajā solī izvēloties <guilabel>Component: docs</guilabel> (vai "
"<guilabel>general</guilabel>, ja komponenta <guilabel>docs</guilabel> nav). "
"Ja komentārs attiecas uz vispārīgu MATE dokumentāciju (piemēram, <citetitle>"
"MATE Users Guide</citetitle>), nevis uz konkrētas lietotnes rokasgrāmatu, "
"izvēlieties <guilabel>Product: mate-user-docs</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:62
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can just send your comments by email to the <link "
"xlink:href=\"http://ml.mate-desktop.org/listinfo\">MATE Documentation "
"Project</link> mailing list."
msgstr ""
"Komentārus var arī vienkārši nosūtīt pa e-pastu <link xlink:href=\"http://"
"ml.mate-desktop.org/listinfo\">MATE dokumentācijas projekta</link> adresātu "
"sarakstam."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:70
msgid "Joining the MATE Project"
msgstr "Pievienošanās MATE projektam"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:71
msgid ""
"We hope you enjoy using MATE and that you find working with MATE productive."
" However, there is always room for improvement."
msgstr ""
"Ceram, ka jums patīk lietot MATE un darbs ar MATE ir ražīgs. Tomēr uzlabot "
"vienmēr ir ko."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:72
msgid ""
"MATE invites you to join our free software community if you have some spare "
"time. There are many different fields. MATE needs programmers, but it also "
"needs translators, documentation writers, testers, artists, writers, and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Ja jums ir brīvs laiks, MATE aicina pievienoties mūsu brīvās programmatūras "
"kopienai. Jomu ir daudz: MATE vajag programmētājus, taču arī tulkotājus, "
