"atvilktnes ikonu."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:52
msgid "file extension"
msgstr "faila paplašinājums"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:54
msgid ""
"The final portion of a file's name, after the last period (.) in the name. "
"For example, the file extension of the file "
"<filename>picture.jpeg</filename> is <filename>jpeg</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Pēdējā faila nosaukuma daļa aiz pēdējā punkta (.) nosaukumā. Piemēram, faila "
"<filename>picture.jpeg</filename> paplašinājums ir <filename>jpeg</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:55
msgid ""
"The file extension can identify the type of file. "
"<application>Caja</application> file manager uses this information when to "
"determine what to do when you open a file. For more on this, see <xref "
"linkend=\"caja-open-file\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Pēc faila paplašinājuma var noteikt faila tipu. Failu pārvaldnieks "
"<application>Caja</application> pēc šīs informācijas nosaka, ko darīt, "
"atverot failu. Plašāku informāciju skatiet <xref linkend=\"caja-open-file\"/>"
"."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:59
msgid "format"
msgstr "formatēt"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:61
msgid ""
"To format media is to prepare the media for use with a particular file "
"system. When you format media, you overwrite any existing information on the"
" media."
msgstr ""
"Formatēt datu nesēju nozīmē sagatavot to lietošanai ar noteiktu failu "
"sistēmu. Formatējot datu nesēju, visa tajā esošā informācija tiek "
"pārrakstīta."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:67
msgid "MATE-compliant application"
msgstr "MATE saderīga lietotne"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:69
msgid ""
"An application that uses the standard MATE programming libraries is called a"
" MATE-compliant application. For example, <application>Caja</application> "
"file manager and <application>pluma</application> text editor are MATE-"
"compliant applications."
msgstr ""
"Lietotni, kas izmanto standarta MATE programmēšanas bibliotēkas, sauc par "
"MATE saderīgu lietotni. Piemēram, failu pārvaldnieks <application>Caja</"
"application> un teksta redaktors <application>pluma</application> ir MATE "
"saderīgas lietotnes."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:75
msgid "IP address"
msgstr "IP adrese"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:77
msgid "A unique numeric identifier for a computer on a network."
msgstr "Unikāls skaitlisks identifikators datoram tīklā."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:81
msgid "keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "īsinājumtaustiņš"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:83
msgid ""
"A <firstterm>keyboard shortcut</firstterm> is a key or combination of keys "
"that provides an alternative to standard ways of performing an action."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>Īsinājumtaustiņš</firstterm> ir taustiņš vai taustiņu "
"kombinācija, kas ļauj veikt darbību citādi nekā parastajā veidā."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:88
msgid "launcher"
msgstr "palaidējs"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:90
msgid ""
"A launcher starts a particular application, executes a command, or opens a "
"file. A launcher can reside in a panel or in a menu."
msgstr ""
"Palaidējs palaiž noteiktu lietotni, izpilda komandu vai atver failu. "
"Palaidējs var atrasties panelī vai izvēlnē."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:95
msgid "menubar"
msgstr "izvēļņu josla"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:97
msgid ""
"A menubar is a bar at the top of an application window that contains the "
"menus for the application."
msgstr ""
"Izvēļņu josla ir josla lietotnes loga augšdaļā, kurā ir lietotnes izvēlnes."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:102
msgid "MIME type"
msgstr "MIME tips"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:104
msgid ""
"A Multipurpose Internet Mail Extension (MIME) type identifies the format of "
"a file. The MIME type enables applications to read the file. For example, an"
" email application can use the <literal>image/png</literal> MIME type to "
"detect that a Portable Networks Graphic (PNG) file is attached to an email."
msgstr ""
"MIME (Multipurpose Internet Mail Extension) tips norāda faila formātu un "
"ļauj lietotnēm nolasīt failu. Piemēram, e-pasta lietotne pēc MIME tipa "
"<literal>image/png</literal> var noteikt, ka e-pasta vēstulei pievienots PNG "
"(Portable Network Graphics) fails."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:112
msgid "mount"
msgstr "montēt"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:114
msgid ""
"To mount is to make a file system available for access. When you mount a "
"file system, the file system is attached as a subdirectory to your file "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Montēt nozīmē padarīt failu sistēmu pieejamu. Montējot failu sistēmu, tā "
"tiek pievienota jūsu failu sistēmai kā apakšdirektorija."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:120
msgid "pane"
msgstr "rūts"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:122
msgid ""
"A pane is a subdivision of a window. For example, the "
"<application>Caja</application> window contains a side pane and a view pane."
msgstr ""
"Rūts ir loga daļa. Piemēram, <application>Caja</application> logā ir sānu "
"rūts un skata rūts."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:126
msgid "preference tool"
msgstr "iestatījumu rīks"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:128
msgid ""
"A dedicated software tool that controls a particular part of the behavior of"
" the MATE Desktop."
msgstr ""
"Īpašs programmatūras rīks, kas nosaka kādu MATE darbvirsmas uzvedības daļu."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:133
msgid "shortcut keys"
msgstr "īsinājumtaustiņi"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:135
msgid ""
"Shortcut keys are keystrokes that provide a quick way to perform an action."
msgstr ""
"Īsinājumtaustiņi ir taustiņu kombinācijas, ar kurām darbību var veikt ātri."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:140
msgid "stacking order"
msgstr "kārtojums kaudzē"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:142
msgid ""
"The stacking order is the order in which windows are stacked on top of each "
"other on your screen."
msgstr "Kārtojums kaudzē ir secība, kādā logi ekrānā sakrauti cits virs cita."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:147
msgid "statusbar"
msgstr "statusa josla"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:149
msgid ""
"A statusbar is a bar at the bottom of a window that provides information "
"about the current state of what you are viewing in the window."
msgstr ""
"Statusa josla ir josla loga apakšā, kurā redzama informācija par logā "
"skatītā satura pašreizējo stāvokli."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:154
msgid "symbolic link"
msgstr "simboliskā saite"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:156
msgid ""
"A special type of file that points to another file or folder. When you "
"perform an action on a symbolic link, the action is performed on the file or"
" folder to which the symbolic link points."
msgstr ""
"Īpašs fails, kas norāda uz citu failu vai mapi. Darbības ar simbolisko saiti "
"tiek veiktas ar failu vai mapi, uz kuru tā norāda."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:162
msgid "toolbar"
msgstr "rīkjosla"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:164
msgid ""
"A toolbar is a bar that contains buttons for the most commonly-used commands"
" in an application. Typically, a toolbar appears under a menubar."
msgstr ""
"Rīkjosla ir josla ar lietotnes biežāk lietoto komandu pogām. Parasti "
"rīkjosla atrodas zem izvēļņu joslas."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:169
msgid "Uniform Resource Identifier"
msgstr "Vienotais resursu identifikators"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:171
msgid ""
"A Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) is a string that identifies a particular"
" location in a file system or on the Web. For example, the address of a web "
"page is a URI."
msgstr ""
"Vienotais resursu identifikators (URI) ir virkne, kas norāda noteiktu vietu "
"failu sistēmā vai tīmeklī. Piemēram, tīmekļa lapas adrese ir URI."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:177
msgid "Uniform Resource Locator"
msgstr "Vienotais resursu vietrādis"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:179
msgid ""
"A Uniform Resource Locator (URL) is the address of a particular location on "
"the Web."
msgstr "Vienotais resursu vietrādis (URL) ir noteiktas vietas adrese tīmeklī."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:184
msgid "view"
msgstr "skats"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:186
msgid ""
"A <application>Caja</application> component that enables you to display a "
"folder in a particular way. For example, <application>Caja</application> "
"contains an icon view which enables you to display the contents of a folder "
"as icons. <application>Caja</application> also contains a list view which "
"enables you to display the contents of a folder as a list."
msgstr ""
"<application>Caja</application> komponents, kas ļauj noteiktā veidā rādīt "
"mapi. Piemēram, <application>Caja</application> ir ikonu skats, kurā mapes "
"saturs redzams kā ikonas, un saraksta skats, kurā mapes saturs redzams kā "
"saraksts."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:193
msgid "workspace"
msgstr "darba vieta"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:195
msgid ""
"A workspace is a discrete area in the MATE Desktop in which you can work."
msgstr "Darba vieta ir atsevišķs MATE darbvirsmas apgabals, kurā var strādāt."
